 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAtelier Provence SAS                                  MASTER SERVICES\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo, 69001 Lyon, France                     AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR21 037277461\n\nFROM                                                     FACTURÉ À\nAtelier Provence SAS                                     Atelier Provence SAS\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo                                    45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n69001 Lyon                                               13001 Marseille\nFrance                                                   France\nVAT: FR21 037277461\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 15/01/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Atelier Provence SAS, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Lyon\n(\"Party A\"), and Atelier Provence SAS, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Marseille\n(\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Atelier Provence SAS / Sophie Bernard\n Party B   Atelier Provence SAS / Sophie Bernard\n Date      15/01/2026",
